Eight classes down, five to go. It took four attempts to
succeed with a ranger. I'm still grieving over Dennom's
immediate predecessor who died on the quest to the second
forest centaur with a /oDeath. Poor fellow never found
reflection or MR and was at the point of choosing between
the quest and the castle.

